<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intermedia Comm begun.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intermedia Comm begun.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it initiated coverage of Intermedia Communications Inc as a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Thursday, Intermedia said it agreed to buy DIGEX Inc for $13 a share or about $150 million.</p>
<p>-- Intermedia added 3/4 to 29-1/4.</p>
</text>
